{"seq":1,"slug":"style-dictionary","title":"Style Dictionary 构建工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/tooling-and-pipeline/style-dictionary","wordCount":1575,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"style-dictionary-构建工具\">Style Dictionary 构建工具</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Style Dictionary（亚马逊 2015 年开源）是设计令牌的行业标准构建工具——将单一的 JSON 令牌源文件转换为多平台输出（CSS 变量 / SCSS / Sass / iOS Swift / Android XML / React Native / 任意自定义格式）。它通过转换器（Transform，值变换如 <code>16px</code> → <code>16</code> 用于 iOS）+ 格式器（Format，输出模板）+ 过滤器（Filter，选择输出的令牌子集）实现跨平台的单一数据源。本节详细讲解 Style Dictionary 的核心概念、配置方法、自定义转换器与格式器、引用解析机制、与 W3C 设计令牌规范的关系，以及最佳实践。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据源</td>\n<td>令牌 JSON 文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解析器</td>\n<td>读取 JSON 并解析引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转换器</td>\n<td>值变换（如 <code>16px</code> → <code>16</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过滤器</td>\n<td>选择令牌子集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格式器</td>\n<td>输出模板（CSS、Swift、XML）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动作</td>\n<td>自定义构建动作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么选择-style-dictionary\">为什么选择 Style Dictionary</h2><p><strong>痛点问题</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>颜色、间距等设计值散落在代码库各处。</li>\n<li>Web、iOS、Android 各自独立维护。</li>\n<li>各平台之间严重偏移不一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>解决方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单一 JSON 文件作为唯一数据源。</li>\n<li>构建命令自动生成各平台特定的输出文件。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>行业采用情况</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>亚马逊、Salesforce、Atlassian、Adobe、Shopify 等均在使用。</li>\n<li>开源 npm 包，社区活跃。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"基础配置\">基础配置</h2><p><strong>安装</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm install -D style-dictionary\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> style-dictionary</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>令牌 JSON 文件</strong>（<code>tokens/color.json</code>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;color&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;blue&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;500&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;#3b82f6&quot; }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;action&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;primary&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{color.blue.500}&quot; }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"blue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"500\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#3b82f6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{color.blue.500}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>配置文件</strong>（<code>config.js</code>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"module.exports = {&#10;  source: [&#39;tokens/**/*.json&#39;],&#10;  platforms: {&#10;    css: {&#10;      transformGroup: &#39;css&#39;,&#10;      buildPath: &#39;build/css/&#39;,&#10;      files: [&#10;        {&#10;          destination: &#39;variables.css&#39;,&#10;          format: &#39;css/variables&#39;,&#10;        },&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;    iOS: {&#10;      transformGroup: &#39;ios&#39;,&#10;      buildPath: &#39;build/ios/&#39;,&#10;      files: [&#10;        {&#10;          destination: &#39;tokens.swift&#39;,&#10;          format: &#39;ios-swift/class.swift&#39;,&#10;          className: &#39;DesignTokens&#39;,&#10;        },&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;    android: {&#10;      transformGroup: &#39;android&#39;,&#10;      buildPath: &#39;build/android/&#39;,&#10;      files: [&#10;        {&#10;          destination: &#39;colors.xml&#39;,&#10;          format: &#39;android/colors&#39;,&#10;        },&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module.exports = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  source: ['tokens/**/*.json'],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  platforms: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    css: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      transformGroup: 'css',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      buildPath: 'build/css/',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      files: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          destination: 'variables.css',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          format: 'css/variables',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    iOS: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      transformGroup: 'ios',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      buildPath: 'build/ios/',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      files: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          destination: 'tokens.swift',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          format: 'ios-swift/class.swift',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          className: 'DesignTokens',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    android: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      transformGroup: 'android',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      buildPath: 'build/android/',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      files: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          destination: 'colors.xml',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          format: 'android/colors',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>执行构建</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npx style-dictionary build\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> style-dictionary</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>输出结果</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"build/css/variables.css&#10;build/ios/tokens.swift&#10;build/android/colors.xml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>build/css/variables.css</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>build/ios/tokens.swift</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>build/android/colors.xml</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"引用解析\">引用解析</h2><p><strong>令牌引用语法</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;color.action.primary&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{color.blue.500}&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color.action.primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{color.blue.500}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Style Dictionary 自动解析</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>{color.blue.500}</code> → <code>#3b82f6</code>。</li>\n<li>支持多级链式引用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>输出方式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CSS：<code>--color-action-primary: #3b82f6;</code>（解析后的值）。</li>\n<li>或保留引用 <code>--color-action-primary: var(--color-blue-500);</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"转换器\">转换器</h2><p><strong>转换器将令牌值变换为各平台适配的格式</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>内置转换器</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>attribute/cti</code>：解析 <code>类别.类型.项目</code> 结构。</li>\n<li><code>name/cti/kebab</code>：生成连字符命名如 <code>color-action-primary</code>。</li>\n<li><code>size/px</code>：保留像素单位。</li>\n<li><code>size/dp</code>：iOS 使用 dp 数值。</li>\n<li><code>color/hex</code>：保留十六进制格式。</li>\n<li><code>color/rgb</code>：转换为 RGBA 格式。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>转换器组（Transform Group）</strong> 是转换器的集合：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>css</code>：连字符命名 + 像素单位 + 十六进制颜色。</li>\n<li><code>ios</code>：驼峰命名 + 数值 + RGB 颜色。</li>\n<li><code>android</code>：下划线命名 + dp 单位 + 十六进制颜色。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"格式器\">格式器</h2><p><strong>格式器是输出模板</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>内置格式器</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>css/variables</code>：CSS 变量格式。</li>\n<li><code>scss/variables</code>：SCSS 变量格式。</li>\n<li><code>ios-swift/class.swift</code>：Swift 类。</li>\n<li><code>android/colors</code>：Android XML 资源。</li>\n<li><code>javascript/object</code>：JavaScript 对象。</li>\n<li><code>typescript/es6-declarations</code>：TypeScript 声明文件。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>CSS 输出示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\":root {&#10;  --color-blue-500: #3b82f6;&#10;  --color-action-primary: #3b82f6;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:root</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --color-blue-500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">#3b82f6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --color-action-primary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">#3b82f6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Swift 输出示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"public class DesignTokens {&#10;  public static let colorBlue500 = UIColor(red: 0.231, green: 0.510, blue: 0.965, alpha: 1)&#10;  public static let colorActionPrimary = UIColor(red: 0.231, green: 0.510, blue: 0.965, alpha: 1)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DesignTokens</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> colorBlue500 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> UIColor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">red</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.231</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">green</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.510</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">blue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.965</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">alpha</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> colorActionPrimary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> UIColor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">red</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.231</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">green</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.510</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">blue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.965</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">alpha</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"自定义转换器\">自定义转换器</h2><p><strong>编写自定义转换器</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"StyleDictionary.registerTransform({&#10;  name: &#39;size/rem&#39;,&#10;  type: &#39;value&#39;,&#10;  matcher: (token) =&gt; token.attributes.category === &#39;spacing&#39;,&#10;  transformer: (token) =&gt; `${parseInt(token.value) / 16}rem`,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>StyleDictionary.registerTransform({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: 'size/rem',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type: 'value',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  matcher: (token) => token.attributes.category === 'spacing',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  transformer: (token) => `${parseInt(token.value) / 16}rem`,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>用途</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>将 <code>16px</code> 转换为 <code>1rem</code>。</li>\n<li>用于 Web 端响应式尺寸。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"自定义格式器\">自定义格式器</h2><p><strong>编写自定义格式器</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"StyleDictionary.registerFormat({&#10;  name: &#39;json/flat&#39;,&#10;  formatter: ({ dictionary }) =&gt; {&#10;    const flat = {};&#10;    dictionary.allTokens.forEach((token) =&gt; {&#10;      flat[token.name] = token.value;&#10;    });&#10;    return JSON.stringify(flat, null, 2);&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>StyleDictionary.registerFormat({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: 'json/flat',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  formatter: ({ dictionary }) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const flat = {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    dictionary.allTokens.forEach((token) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      flat[token.name] = token.value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return JSON.stringify(flat, null, 2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>用途</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>为特殊工具生成自定义输出格式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"过滤器\">过滤器</h2><p><strong>输出令牌子集</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"files: [&#10;  {&#10;    destination: &#39;colors.css&#39;,&#10;    format: &#39;css/variables&#39;,&#10;    filter: (token) =&gt; token.attributes.category === &#39;color&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>files: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    destination: 'colors.css',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    format: 'css/variables',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    filter: (token) => token.attributes.category === 'color',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>仅输出颜色类别的令牌。</p>\n<p><strong>使用场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按类别拆分文件（color.css、spacing.css）。</li>\n<li>按组件拆分文件（button.css）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"多平台流水线\">多平台流水线</h2><p><strong>实际项目配置</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"{&#10;  source: [&#39;tokens/**/*.json&#39;],&#10;  platforms: {&#10;    web: {&#10;      transformGroup: &#39;css&#39;,&#10;      buildPath: &#39;dist/web/&#39;,&#10;      files: [&#10;        { destination: &#39;tokens.css&#39;, format: &#39;css/variables&#39; },&#10;        { destination: &#39;tokens.scss&#39;, format: &#39;scss/variables&#39; },&#10;        { destination: &#39;tokens.js&#39;, format: &#39;javascript/es6&#39; },&#10;        { destination: &#39;tokens.d.ts&#39;, format: &#39;typescript/es6-declarations&#39; }&#10;      ]&#10;    },&#10;    ios: {&#10;      transformGroup: &#39;ios-swift&#39;,&#10;      buildPath: &#39;dist/ios/&#39;,&#10;      files: [&#10;        { destination: &#39;DesignTokens.swift&#39;, format: &#39;ios-swift/class.swift&#39; }&#10;      ]&#10;    },&#10;    android: {&#10;      transformGroup: &#39;android&#39;,&#10;      buildPath: &#39;dist/android/&#39;,&#10;      files: [&#10;        { destination: &#39;colors.xml&#39;, format: &#39;android/colors&#39; },&#10;        { destination: &#39;dimens.xml&#39;, format: &#39;android/dimens&#39; }&#10;      ]&#10;    },&#10;    &#39;react-native&#39;: {&#10;      transformGroup: &#39;react-native&#39;,&#10;      buildPath: &#39;dist/react-native/&#39;,&#10;      files: [&#10;        { destination: &#39;tokens.js&#39;, format: &#39;javascript/object&#39; }&#10;      ]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  source: ['tokens/**/*.json'],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  platforms: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    web: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      transformGroup: 'css',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      buildPath: 'dist/web/',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      files: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        { destination: 'tokens.css', format: 'css/variables' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        { destination: 'tokens.scss', format: 'scss/variables' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        { destination: 'tokens.js', format: 'javascript/es6' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        { destination: 'tokens.d.ts', format: 'typescript/es6-declarations' }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ios: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      transformGroup: 'ios-swift',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      buildPath: 'dist/ios/',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      files: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        { destination: 'DesignTokens.swift', format: 'ios-swift/class.swift' }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    android: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      transformGroup: 'android',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      buildPath: 'dist/android/',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      files: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        { destination: 'colors.xml', format: 'android/colors' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        { destination: 'dimens.xml', format: 'android/dimens' }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    'react-native': {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      transformGroup: 'react-native',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      buildPath: 'dist/react-native/',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      files: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        { destination: 'tokens.js', format: 'javascript/object' }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>一条命令</strong> 即可生成所有平台的输出文件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[令牌 JSON 数据源] --&gt; B[Style Dictionary]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Web CSS / SCSS / JS / TS]&#10;    B --&gt; D[iOS Swift]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Android XML]&#10;    B --&gt; F[React Native]&#10;    B --&gt; G[自定义格式]\">graph LR\n    A[令牌 JSON 数据源] --&gt; B[Style Dictionary]\n    B --&gt; C[Web CSS / SCSS / JS / TS]\n    B --&gt; D[iOS Swift]\n    B --&gt; E[Android XML]\n    B --&gt; F[React Native]\n    B --&gt; G[自定义格式]</pre><h2 id=\"持续集成\">持续集成</h2><p><strong>令牌变更时自动构建</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/tokens.yml&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    paths: [&#39;tokens/**&#39;]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  build:&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - run: npm ci&#10;      - run: npm run build:tokens&#10;      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v3&#10;        with:&#10;          path: dist/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/tokens.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tokens/**'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm run build:tokens</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/upload-artifact@v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dist/</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>自动发布</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>构建完成后自动发布 npm 包。</li>\n<li>消费方自动获取更新。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"版本控制\">版本控制</h2><p><strong>使用语义化版本号</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>令牌变更对应版本升级。</li>\n<li>主版本（Major）：破坏性变更（重命名、删除）。</li>\n<li>次版本（Minor）：新增令牌。</li>\n<li>补丁版本（Patch）：数值微调。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>工具推荐</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>changesets（推荐）。</li>\n<li>semantic-release（自动化）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"令牌校验\">令牌校验</h2><p><strong>验证令牌质量</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有令牌必须有值。</li>\n<li>引用目标必须存在。</li>\n<li>命名规范必须遵循约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>自定义校验器</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于 Style Dictionary 解析器。</li>\n<li>编写自定义检查规则。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"w3c-设计令牌规范\">W3C 设计令牌规范</h2><p><strong>W3C 规范草案</strong>（2023 年发布）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;color.primary.500&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;$value&quot;: &quot;#3b82f6&quot;,&#10;    &quot;$type&quot;: &quot;color&quot;,&#10;    &quot;$description&quot;: &quot;品牌主色&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color.primary.500\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"$value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#3b82f6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"$type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"color\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"$description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"品牌主色\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Style Dictionary v4 已支持</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>工具间互通互换。</li>\n<li>格式标准化。</li>\n<li>面向未来兼容。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"其他构建工具\">其他构建工具</h2><p><strong>Theo</strong>（Salesforce 出品）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>功能类似 Style Dictionary。</li>\n<li>已不太活跃。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Tokens Studio CLI</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>从 Figma 同步令牌。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specify</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>商业产品。</li>\n<li>Figma 集成更完善。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>自建方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>大型公司的定制流水线。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>选择建议</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Style Dictionary 是默认首选。</li>\n<li>实际项目中使用最广泛。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"社区插件\">社区插件</h2><p><strong>常用社区插件</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>style-dictionary-utils</code>：实用工具集。</li>\n<li><code>sd-transforms</code>：W3C 规范转换器。</li>\n<li><code>tokens-studio-figma-plugin</code>：Figma 同步插件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 不使用引用</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>到处硬编码值。</li>\n<li>维护极其困难。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 命名不一致</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>color.blue.500</code> 与 <code>color.brand.500</code> 混用。</li>\n<li>缺乏系统性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 不做令牌校验</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>拼写错误无法发现。</li>\n<li>引用链路断裂。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 手动构建各平台</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>应使用 Style Dictionary 自动化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 不做版本管理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>消费方无法感知更新。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战建议\">实战建议</h2><p><strong>1. 从小处开始</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>先做颜色和间距令牌。</li>\n<li>后续逐步添加排版、阴影等。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 记录构建命令</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>npm run build:tokens</code>——构建令牌。</li>\n<li><code>npm run watch:tokens</code>——监听变更。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 持续集成检查</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每次 PR 触发构建。</li>\n<li>验证输出正确性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 自动发布</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>令牌变更后自动发布 npm 包。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 消费方文档</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>说明如何使用令牌。</li>\n<li>提供使用示例。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Style Dictionary（亚马逊 2015 年开源）是设计令牌构建的行业标准工具——将 JSON 令牌数据源转换为多平台输出（CSS / SCSS / JS / TS / Swift / Android XML / React Native）。流水线由解析器（读取 JSON + 解析引用）+ 转换器（值变换如 <code>16px</code> → <code>16</code> 用于 iOS）+ 过滤器（子集选择）+ 格式器（输出模板）组成。引用自动解析 <code>{color.blue.500}</code> → <code>#3b82f6</code>，支持多级链式引用。转换器组（css / ios / android）打包常用转换，也支持自定义转换器（如 size/rem）。内置格式器包括 css/variables、scss/variables、ios-swift、android/colors、javascript/object、typescript/declaration，也支持自定义格式器。过滤器实现按类别拆分文件（color.css、spacing.css）。多平台输出一条命令即可生成。持续集成在令牌变更时自动构建并发布 npm 包。版本管理工具推荐 changesets 或 semantic-release。令牌校验确保所有值存在、引用有效、命名规范。W3C 规范草案（2023 年，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">value/</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span></span></span></span></span>type/$description）已被 Style Dictionary v4 支持，实现工具间互通。其他工具如 Theo（Salesforce）、Tokens Studio CLI、Specify 是替代选项，但 Style Dictionary 在实际项目中使用最广泛。社区插件 style-dictionary-utils、sd-transforms、tokens-studio 提供扩展能力。应避免的反模式包括：不使用引用、命名不一致、不做校验、手动构建和不做版本管理。建议从小处开始 + 记录命令 + 持续集成检查 + 自动发布 + 消费方文档。Style Dictionary 是设计令牌工程化的核心工具——让跨平台令牌流水线从设想变为日常实践。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Style Dictionary 构建工具","id":"style-dictionary-构建工具"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么选择 Style Dictionary","id":"为什么选择-style-dictionary"},{"level":2,"text":"基础配置","id":"基础配置"},{"level":2,"text":"引用解析","id":"引用解析"},{"level":2,"text":"转换器","id":"转换器"},{"level":2,"text":"格式器","id":"格式器"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义转换器","id":"自定义转换器"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义格式器","id":"自定义格式器"},{"level":2,"text":"过滤器","id":"过滤器"},{"level":2,"text":"多平台流水线","id":"多平台流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"持续集成","id":"持续集成"},{"level":2,"text":"版本控制","id":"版本控制"},{"level":2,"text":"令牌校验","id":"令牌校验"},{"level":2,"text":"W3C 设计令牌规范","id":"w3c-设计令牌规范"},{"level":2,"text":"其他构建工具","id":"其他构建工具"},{"level":2,"text":"社区插件","id":"社区插件"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"实战建议","id":"实战建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"间距与布局令牌","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/token-architecture/spacing-and-layout-tokens"},"next":{"title":"Figma 令牌与同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/tooling-and-pipeline/figma-tokens-and-sync"}}